    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casa Caballero is a single-player, first-person survival horror game set in a fictional area in the Philippines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When your colleagues failed to return from their assignment, you are tasked to look for them in a house filled with secrets and with a resident that seems to force its visitors to stay for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/75c31d9e497437fe7f3535efb87005f9.poster.avif?t=1752948452\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/75c31d9e497437fe7f3535efb87005f9.webm?t=1752948452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/75c31d9e497437fe7f3535efb87005f9.mp4?t=1752948452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the mysteries of Casa Caballero and its residents through notes scattered across the property.\u00a0Keep your eyes open for clues and items to solve puzzles and unlock new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/824b11f4b9b77b84a585429762f788cd.poster.avif?t=1752948452\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/824b11f4b9b77b84a585429762f788cd.webm?t=1752948452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/824b11f4b9b77b84a585429762f788cd.mp4?t=1752948452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with only a pistol, you must fight off the horrors lurking in the house while evading those that cannot be killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/9ae9a66a3d7a3bdc5718fdda5d3cf70e.poster.avif?t=1752948452\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/9ae9a66a3d7a3bdc5718fdda5d3cf70e.webm?t=1752948452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/9ae9a66a3d7a3bdc5718fdda5d3cf70e.mp4?t=1752948452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for an immersive experience that will test your problem-solving skills so you can escape Casa Caballero in one piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic Graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engaging puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Occasional first-person shooting</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Setting and story inspired by Philippine history, culture, and folklore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The approximate duration of the game is 60-90mins.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casa Caballero is a single-player, first-person survival horror game set in a fictional area in the Philippines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When your colleagues failed to return from their assignment, you are tasked to look for them in a house filled with secrets and with a resident that seems to force its visitors to stay for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/75c31d9e497437fe7f3535efb87005f9.poster.avif?t=1752948452\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/75c31d9e497437fe7f3535efb87005f9.webm?t=1752948452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/75c31d9e497437fe7f3535efb87005f9.mp4?t=1752948452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the mysteries of Casa Caballero and its residents through notes scattered across the property.\u00a0Keep your eyes open for clues and items to solve puzzles and unlock new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/824b11f4b9b77b84a585429762f788cd.poster.avif?t=1752948452\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/824b11f4b9b77b84a585429762f788cd.webm?t=1752948452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/824b11f4b9b77b84a585429762f788cd.mp4?t=1752948452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with only a pistol, you must fight off the horrors lurking in the house while evading those that cannot be killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/9ae9a66a3d7a3bdc5718fdda5d3cf70e.poster.avif?t=1752948452\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/9ae9a66a3d7a3bdc5718fdda5d3cf70e.webm?t=1752948452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702590/extras/9ae9a66a3d7a3bdc5718fdda5d3cf70e.mp4?t=1752948452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for an immersive experience that will test your problem-solving skills so you can escape Casa Caballero in one piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic Graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engaging puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Occasional first-person shooting</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Setting and story inspired by Philippine history, culture, and folklore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The approximate duration of the game is 60-90mins.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "A city hall surveyor searches for his missing colleagues in a bahay-na-bato, only to uncover the house's sinister ties to Philippine history and folklore. Explore items and records, solve puzzles, and face enemies as you unravel the mysteries within and beyond the property walls",
